      "role": "user",
      "content": "folders like 'work projects' won't work. this isn't just personal stuff or tasks. it's more like... data that shouldn't be lost when the shift happens. i'm talking about historical details that don't exist in books anymore, specific sensory patterns from events that everyone else has forgotten, and core human truths. i need a way to archive these so they stay preserved even if the original source (my mind) can't hold them anymore. can you help me create a structure that handles high-density, high-importance ontological data?",
